.DS_Store
# GitHub App private keys and any PEM. The merchant key downloads once from
# GitHub and must never enter version control — a key in git history is a key
# in every clone forever. Server env only, never NEXT_PUBLIC_.
*.pem
*.key
# Operator scaffolding (agent roster, workflows, local config) is local-only;
# this repository carries the console code and the README.
.opencode/
opencode.json

# Migrations are applied live and mirrored to the SDK repo; this repository
# does not carry the database.
supabase/

# Former runtime-SDK snapshot. Nothing in the build reads it anymore; kept
# on disk for local reference only.
vendor/

# Internal docs (plans, decision log, runbooks) stay on disk, not in git.
*.md
!README.md

# Netlify env sheet WITH SECRET VALUES (owner-generated 2026-10-07).
# Same rule as .pem: never committed, never shared. Mode 0600.
netlify-env.md
